{"version":1,"content":"<p>王梓軒包辦編劇、監製及主演的英語微短劇《選美兄弟班》（Rags 2 Richmond），於2024年12月以網劇形式發布後，在短短3星期內錄得逾900萬點擊率，成績斐然。</p><p>製作團隊隨後開發電影版權相關項目，並邀得曾志偉加盟，電影版亦正式更名為《皇冠之音》。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:20:42.979673+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:52:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:17:33.873360+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:40.256529+00:00","content_hash":"dcfbff601ed6e5cedc769e183f2480322093cade5bec107257a9af65afcf40bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}